# rocq-mcp scratch/cache files
rocq_mcp_cache_*.v

# Throwaway diagnostic probes (cfgver-scaling-diagnostics convention).
# These are measurement scaffolding: never in _CoqProject, and they contain
# `Admitted.` because they measure a VC's cost rather than proving it. They
# must stay UNTRACKED -- scripts/gate.sh's hole scan reads the filesystem, so
# committing them blocks the merge gate outright. That happened twice
# (2026-08-13's ZZKsl* set, and once before), hence this rule.
case_study/RiscvPmp/CFGVer/Example/ZZ*

# Per-user state of the learning plugins (VibeWise, vibe-learn, while-you-wait).
# wyw.json + decks are deliberately NOT committed (Emiel, 2026-10-08, PLAN-spec-layer
# Phase S) -- against the plugin's own advice; decks are private study material.
.vibe-wise/
.vibe-learn/
**/.claude/wyw.json
**/.claude/decks/
**/.claude/wyw/
**/.claude/wyw-review*.md

# per-machine phase-handoff pointer (PLAN-context-economy D11; written by /handoff)
.claude/HANDOFF
# phase-runner.sh logs: stream-json transcripts, runs.tsv, stops.log, lock (PLAN-context-economy 2b)
.claude/runner-logs/
